          <a href="#how-preemergents-work" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">2. How They Work</a>
          <a href="#top-picks" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">3. Our 6 Picks</a>
          <a href="#timing" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">4. When to Apply</a>
          <a href="#active-ingredients" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">5. Active Ingredients</a>
