            The <strong class="text-white">best crabgrass preventer</strong> for most established lawns is <strong class="text-white">Scotts Turf Builder with Halts</strong>, which pairs a proven pendimethalin barrier with a spring feeding. If you tend to apply late, a dithiopyr product like <strong class="text-white">Jonathan Green Veri-Green Plus</strong> gives you a margin, and <strong class="text-white">Prodiamine 65 WDG</strong> is the economical choice for large lawns.
